  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Choice, Equity, and Sustainability for Services (ACCESS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Global Health (GH)):  In line with USAID and broader U.S. government priorities, and with a sharp focus on achieving family planning (FP) and reproductive health (RH)-related outcomes through local capacity strengthening, this service delivery mechanism contributes to preventing maternal and child deaths; improving women&apos;s and girls&apos; opportunities for education, employment, and full participation in society; and ensuring local ownership of FP/RH priorities, resources, and implementation. Furthermore, by targeting interventions at the health system, facility, provider, community, and client levels, the award assists USAID-supported countries to constructively and creatively reduce barriers to FP/RH services and address long-standing issues related to access, equity, and quality of care.</narrative>
  </description>
